# twin: render_one
# One console that draws the two-part picture in OpenGL, in a 3.3 core
# context with the framebuffer's first row the picture's top: the harness
# reads each frame back, and the trace and the checkpoints' pictures are
# those of the software picture.
console 0 core=test render=gl
option 0 link_test_render gl
30 checkpoint early
60 save mid
60 checkpoint mid
120 end
